{"version":1,"page":{"kind":"annotation-detail","href":"/shijing/annotation/073-da-che/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi","dataHref":"/__data/shijing/annotation/073-da-che/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/data.json","title":"詩經注析 · 大車 · 注释总览","description":"風 · 王風 · 大車 · 汇集《詩經注析》关于《大車》的 1 条注释，含 1 条注脚。"},"payload":{"detail":{"route":{"poemId":"073-da-che","materialId":"chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi"},"href":"/shijing/annotation/073-da-che/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi","poem":{"id":"073-da-che","title":"大車","categoryId":"feng","subcategoryId":"wangfeng","path":["風","王風","大車"],"segments":[{"id":"seg-001","text":"大车槛槛","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-002","text":"毳衣如菼","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-003","text":"岂不尔思","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-004","text":"畏子不敢","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-005","text":"大车啍啍","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-006","text":"毳衣如璊","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-007","text":"岂不尔思","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-008","text":"畏子不奔","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-009","text":"榖则异室","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-010","text":"死则同穴","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-011","text":"谓予不信","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-012","text":"有如皦日","isActive":true}]},"material":{"id":"chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi","title":"詩經注析","authors":["程俊英","蔣見元"],"contributorLine":"现代 · 程俊英、蔣見元","era":"现代","publicationYear":1991,"carrier":"PDF"},"stats":{"annotationCount":1,"glossCount":1},"annotations":[{"id":"0001","order":1,"total":1,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"大车槛槛，毳衣如菼。岂不尔思？畏子不敢。大车啍啍，毳衣如璊。岂不尔思？畏子不奔。榖则异室，死则同穴。谓予不信，有如皦日。","targetNotes":"全篇题解与注释。","sourceLabel":"第 165-167 页","sourceNotes":"据 /private/tmp/071-cheng/p006.png（书页 165，题解起始）、/tmp/073-cheng-more/p001.png（书页 166）及 /tmp/073-cheng-more/p002.png（书页 167）定位。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0001-1","attributionLabel":"程俊英","sectionLabel":"题解","text":"程俊英释《大车》为女子热恋情人而又有所畏惧、不敢私奔的诗，末章以“死则同穴”“有如皦日”明誓，既大胆炽热，又不失矜持。她又依次训“槛槛”为车行声，“毳衣”为用兽毛织成并加彩绣的衣裳，“菼”为初生荻色，“尔”“子”都指所恋男子，“啍啍”为车行缓重貌，“璊”为赤玉色假借，“奔”为私奔，“榖”为活着，“穴”为墓穴，“皦”为光明，并指出三章韵脚分别是“槛、菼、敢”“啍、璊、奔”“室、穴、日”。","notes":null}]}]}}}
